      "description": "Before running: this service's GET endpoint needs a player to have an assigned scope in the session. AssignScopes is gRPC only, so run this once via grpcurl before using this collection:\n\ngrpcurl -plaintext -proto src/main/proto/university_record.proto -d '{\"session_id\":\"test-session\",\"assignments\":[{\"player_id\":\"player-1\",\"scopes\":[\"enrollment\",\"courses\"]}]}' localhost:9090 UniversityRecordService/AssignScopes\n\nThe collection variable `token_player1` is a hand-built, unsigned JWT with sub=player-1 (signature verification isn't implemented yet, see README). `token_stranger` has sub=someone-never-assigned, used for the 403 case."
